130
00:12:09,195 --> 00:12:15,690
of the elements in the other
two, so that the index is at n.

131
00:12:15,690 --> 00:12:20,890
And then if the two series you
started with are convergent,

132
00:12:20,890 --> 00:12:26,010
then this product series
is also convergent,

133
00:12:26,010 --> 00:12:28,950
and the sum of
the product series

134
00:12:28,950 --> 00:12:34,852
