an infinite number.

423
00:36:15,350 --> 00:36:18,140
But if you're trying to do it--

424
00:36:18,140 --> 00:36:20,930
if the numbers
that you're summing

425
00:36:20,930 --> 00:36:23,840
are all non-negative,
then actually,

426
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:26,990
the ordering doesn't matter.

427
00:36:26,990 --> 00:36:29,810
You can check the fifth
element first and then

428
00:36:29,810 --> 00:36:34,290
the seventh and then the 119
and then come back and take 1.

429
00:36:34,290 --> 00:36:37,490
It doesn't matter what
order you do it in.

430
00:36:37,490 --> 00:36:42,560
But if the numbers
are not non-negative

431
00:36:42,560 --> 00:36:46,070
and the series is not
absolutely convergent, now

432
00:36:46,070 --> 00:36:49,190
