435
00:36:58,680 --> 00:37:02,120
Then you take a few of
the positive elements,

436
00:37:02,120 --> 00:37:04,100
and then you take
more of the negative.

437
00:37:04,100 --> 00:37:08,230
And so then you would
actually stay very far down

438
00:37:08,230 --> 00:37:12,190
toward minus infinity,
and you would never

439
00:37:12,190 --> 00:37:14,660
