443
00:37:27,940 --> 00:37:30,220
and it will still
converge, and it will still

444
00:37:30,220 --> 00:37:32,290
converge to the same number.

445
00:37:32,290 --> 00:37:35,770
If you're trying to
sum infinite numbers

446
00:37:35,770 --> 00:37:42,070
and they are not
non-negative and they

447
00:37:42,070 --> 00:37:47,025
don't converge absolutely,
then the ordering does matter.

448
00:37:47,025 --> 00:37:51,370
And this is related to why we
