00:37:55,490 --> 00:37:57,320
But we won't get into this.

452
00:37:57,320 --> 00:37:58,280
You can read about it.

453
00:37:58,280 --> 00:37:59,700
It's a sort of standard fact.

454
00:37:59,700 --> 00:38:03,410
It's certainly somewhere in
the book, but it's not fun.

455
00:38:03,410 --> 00:38:04,880
AUDIENCE: How do
we reconcile that

