457
00:38:08,720 --> 00:38:13,820
TOBIAS COLDING: Yeah,
so it's related to--

458
00:38:18,020 --> 00:38:20,460
again, this is not
part of the syllabus,

459
00:38:20,460 --> 00:38:24,335
but I think it's a useful thing
