480
00:39:40,210 --> 00:39:44,010
be where a n is 1/n.

481
00:39:44,010 --> 00:39:47,140
That's a monotone sequence.

482
00:39:47,140 --> 00:39:50,190
So if you take a monotone
sequence like this-- but

483
00:39:50,190 --> 00:39:54,370
it doesn't need to
