00:40:06,320 --> 00:40:08,960
this one here is convergent.

488
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:10,500
This one here is convergent.

489
00:40:13,850 --> 00:40:16,280
And why is it convergent?

490
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:20,000
It's convergent because
