982
01:22:09,800 --> 01:22:14,360
So that's not where the
problem with continuity occurs.

983
01:22:14,360 --> 01:22:17,410
The problem occurs
because you also have

984
01:22:17,410 --> 01:22:19,430
irrational numbers close to it.

985
01:22:19,430 --> 01:22:22,990
And it has to be for
all points close to this

986
01:22:22,990 --> 01:22:25,730
that the value has to
be almost the same.

987
01:22:25,730 --> 01:22:28,930
So it's really for
the irrational numbers

988
01:22:28,930 --> 01:22:32,590
that the problem occurs
with continuity--

989
01:22:32,590 --> 01:22:33,760
in irrational numbers.

990
01:22:33,760 --> 01:22:36,800
And vice versa for an
irrational number--

991
01:22:36,800 --> 01:22:39,710
if you're looking at continuity
around an irrational,

992
01:22:39,710 --> 01:22:42,590
the problem is not from
other irrational numbers,

993
01:22:42,590 --> 01:22:45,270
but is from the
rational numbers.

